  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Pairwise alignment: optimal global (Needleman-Wunsch), optimal local (Smith-Waterman), and seeded local alignment with affine gap penalties, full traceback, CIGAR output, and gapped alignment strings, alongside the v1.1 sequence algorithms (GC content, Hamming and Levenshtein distances, 2-bit packed k-mers, and exact motif search) on the DNA, RNA, and protein sequence foundation.",
